{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 11000}, "text": " So I thought, I want to install internet down in my dungeon, so I thought I've actually got an Ethernet cable in the roof here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 11000, "to": 17000}, "text": " It's not terminated, unfortunately, but it goes... I don't know if you can see that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 24000}, "text": " Anyway, it goes up in the roof, and it goes all the way down the corridor, and I've always wondered where it goes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 31000}, "text": " I assume it goes to the MDF... well, not the MDF, but the junction room down the end of the corridor here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 31000, "to": 35000}, "text": " and then down the shaft right to the MDF room down in the basement."}, {"offsets": {"from": 35000, "to": 40000}, "text": " But I've never actually traced it, but now I've got a tool to actually trace this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 40000, "to": 50000}, "text": " So, I've got Cat5... this is Cat5e cable, so I do believe it should be like a 70 meter, 80 meter, maybe 80 meter total length"}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 57000}, "text": " down to my dungeon via the MDF room. But anyway, let's... yep, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 57000, "to": 61000}, "text": " 20... basically 30 meters. 30 meters, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 66000}, "text": " So we've got 30 meters of cable. That is way more than just down to the corridor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 66000, "to": 73000}, "text": " It's only like 10... I don't know, like 12 meters, maybe 15 tops down to the corridor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 75000}, "text": " I can pace it out, but it's not far, maybe 15 meters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 75000, "to": 83000}, "text": " So I reckon this cable is going down... I did estimate once, and it was about, I think, 30 meters down to the MDF room,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 83000, "to": 90000}, "text": " or something like that. I think this is actually going down into the MDF room, which is fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 90000, "to": 96000}, "text": " Yep, so you can see how it'll follow the twist."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96000, "to": 99000}, "text": " So I'm going to go down the corridor and have a squiz."}, {"offsets": {"from": 99000, "to": 106000}, "text": " So here's the, I guess, like junction cupboard, I don't know what you call it, at the end of the corridor here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 106000, "to": 113000}, "text": " But there you go, it's got all sorts of stuff in here. It's got the patch panel there, and that's where a lot of the Ethernet..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 120000}, "text": " You can see the blue Ethernet trunking coming from down in the floor there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 123000}, "text": " That goes right through the cable guts of this thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 128000}, "text": " Anyway, so I'm going to go in there and have a squiz, see if I can find it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 135000}, "text": " I've got something. Yeah, it's that one. Pretty sure I found it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 138000}, "text": " Winner, winner, chicken dinner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 145000}, "text": " Now, not that it matters, all I really care is that it actually goes down to the basement."}, {"offsets": {"from": 145000, "to": 147000}, "text": " So, ooh, spooky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 151000}, "text": " And here's Chris, he's at it. He's trying to trace the cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 151000, "to": 154000}, "text": " Give us a smile, Chris."}, {"offsets": {"from": 154000, "to": 157000}, "text": " He's trying to find it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 162000}, "text": " He's using a real cable tracer, it's a fluke jobby, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162000, "to": 165000}, "text": " He reckons he had it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 171000}, "text": " You get a sniff, but we assume that the cable comes down here somewhere, but..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 176000}, "text": " I can never be sure. Murphy will ensure that it doesn't."}, {"offsets": {"from": 176000, "to": 179000}, "text": " But, if you've got a sniff..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 179000, "to": 183000}, "text": " Has it, like, given false reading? No?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 185000, "to": 190000}, "text": " No, they go over to that pipe, that fibre box over there, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 195000, "to": 197000}, "text": " Heard something, no?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 197000, "to": 201000}, "text": " It turns itself off the rotary. Oh, OK, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 204000}, "text": " We'll have to get back to you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 204000, "to": 207000}, "text": " Not going to believe it, we found it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 211000}, "text": " We're down on the floor below, and it's just unterminated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211000, "to": 214000}, "text": " Here, it's just flapping around in the breeze."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214000, "to": 217000}, "text": " Yeah, that's not 30 metres, though."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 219000}, "text": " What's going on?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 222000}, "text": " Wow, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 223000, "to": 228000}, "text": " Cable patch from here to there. Patch from here down to the bottom."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228000, "to": 230000}, "text": " All right, no worries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 233000}, "text": " He's back again. Yeah, it was confirmed, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 233000, "to": 238000}, "text": " It was, it went down to the next level down."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238000, "to": 241000}, "text": " Unbelievable. Run a new cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 246000}, "text": " So, yeah, that's the plan, we run a new cable from here, and we..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 246000, "to": 250000}, "text": " And then we patch it to the Cat 5, but it's only Cat 5."}, {"offsets": {"from": 250000, "to": 252000}, "text": " Down through the riser. Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 252000, "to": 256000}, "text": " Take it off that, and then straight to your storeroom, or the dungeon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 258000}, "text": " Dungeon. Awesome. Let's do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 283000}, "text": " And I think this would be easy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 283000, "to": 287000}, "text": " We've only got to go from here to the comms cupboard over there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 287000, "to": 290000}, "text": " but nope, there's a lot of stuff in the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 290000, "to": 292000}, "text": " We found it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295000, "to": 297000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297000, "to": 298000}, "text": " Yep, I've got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 298000, "to": 300000}, "text": " Yep, got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 300000, "to": 302000}, "text": " OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 307000}, "text": " And we've got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307000, "to": 309000}, "text": " And we've got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 309000, "to": 314000}, "text": " There's a huge aircon vent in the way, there's pipes,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 314000, "to": 316000}, "text": " there's all sorts of stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 316000, "to": 317000}, "text": " It's really annoying."}, {"offsets": {"from": 317000, "to": 320000}, "text": " So we had to get under that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 320000, "to": 326000}, "text": " Chris, tell us, how often do people fill in the book, the record book?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 326000, "to": 328000}, "text": " It's hard to look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 331000, "to": 332000}, "text": " How old is this?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 332000, "to": 333000}, "text": " The answer is they don't."}, {"offsets": {"from": 333000, "to": 334000}, "text": " They don't."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 336000}, "text": " No, never."}, {"offsets": {"from": 336000, "to": 338000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 338000, "to": 339000}, "text": " Useless."}, {"offsets": {"from": 339000, "to": 341000}, "text": " What's the point?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 345000, "to": 348000}, "text": " He's going up the drill again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 348000, "to": 351000}, "text": " He's doing it properly, he's got the conduit, the whole works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 351000, "to": 353000}, "text": " Plug my ears."}, {"offsets": {"from": 361000, "to": 363000}, "text": " Check it out, this is one of Chris's tools."}, {"offsets": {"from": 363000, "to": 365000}, "text": " It's a conduit bender."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 371000}, "text": " It's the exact diameter going to a conduit, and you use it for bending the conduit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 371000, "to": 372000}, "text": " Cool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 372000, "to": 375000}, "text": " I didn't know that was an issue, but apparently it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 375000, "to": 379000}, "text": " So you use this little springy tool to do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 379000, "to": 380000}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 380000, "to": 382000}, "text": " We're snakey snake."}, {"offsets": {"from": 384000, "to": 387000}, "text": " I was going to say, show us your arms."}, {"offsets": {"from": 387000, "to": 388000}, "text": " Filthy as."}, {"offsets": {"from": 388000, "to": 389000}, "text": " Car parks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 389000, "to": 390000}, "text": " Yeah, car parks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 390000, "to": 391000}, "text": " Classic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 391000, "to": 393000}, "text": " It's just everywhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 393000, "to": 395000}, "text": " Now comes the fun part."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395000, "to": 397000}, "text": " We've pulled all the cables."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 401000}, "text": " So do you prefer sparky work, or do you prefer comms work?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 401000, "to": 402000}, "text": " Mix it up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 402000, "to": 403000}, "text": " Mix it up, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 404000}, "text": " I use the spice of life."}, {"offsets": {"from": 404000, "to": 405000}, "text": " It depends."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 412000}, "text": " I suppose everything's going towards smart and automation, so data's a bit of a, I don't"}, {"offsets": {"from": 412000, "to": 414000}, "text": " know, foundation again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 414000, "to": 417000}, "text": " So what do you think the total, well, we'll be able to find out what the total run length"}, {"offsets": {"from": 417000, "to": 418000}, "text": " is, won't we?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 418000, "to": 419000}, "text": " We'll be able to measure it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419000, "to": 421000}, "text": " I reckon about 80, less than 80."}, {"offsets": {"from": 421000, "to": 422000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 422000, "to": 423000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 423000, "to": 425000}, "text": " 64."}, {"offsets": {"from": 425000, "to": 426000}, "text": " 64."}, {"offsets": {"from": 426000, "to": 427000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 427000, "to": 429000}, "text": " Nice binary multiple there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 429000, "to": 430000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 430000, "to": 431000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 431000, "to": 432000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 432000, "to": 433000}, "text": " 64 metres."}, {"offsets": {"from": 433000, "to": 434000}, "text": " Let's see if you're right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 434000, "to": 435000}, "text": " Should have brought my crone tool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 435000, "to": 436000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 436000, "to": 437000}, "text": " So I can snap stuff at the same time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 437000, "to": 438000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 438000, "to": 439000}, "text": " But it's in my van."}, {"offsets": {"from": 439000, "to": 440000}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 441000, "to": 442000}, "text": " Going old school."}, {"offsets": {"from": 443000, "to": 446000}, "text": " Electricians, we don't clean up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 450000, "to": 451000}, "text": " It's all right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 451000, "to": 452000}, "text": " I've got a broom."}, {"offsets": {"from": 452000, "to": 453000}, "text": " A sweeper."}, {"offsets": {"from": 453000, "to": 454000}, "text": " Do you have a vacuum?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 456000, "to": 457000}, "text": " Look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 457000, "to": 458000}, "text": " It's like a bought one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 459000, "to": 461000}, "text": " And Bobby Dazzler."}, {"offsets": {"from": 467000, "to": 470000}, "text": " Got to find a spare pair, and of course, they're not going to be labelled well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 470000, "to": 471000}, "text": " No, of course not."}, {"offsets": {"from": 472000, "to": 475000}, "text": " So you're looking at the one that's not going elsewhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 475000, "to": 476000}, "text": " Just on one side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 476000, "to": 477000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 477000, "to": 485000}, "text": " See, all the cables come down and terminate on the top set, and then from the bottom set"}, {"offsets": {"from": 485000, "to": 490000}, "text": " come out and patch to whatever else you want to patch your pair to."}, {"offsets": {"from": 490000, "to": 493000}, "text": " So I reckon that's our spare."}, {"offsets": {"from": 493000, "to": 494000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 494000, "to": 496000}, "text": " Would that physically match upstairs as well?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 496000, "to": 497000}, "text": " Maybe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 497000, "to": 498000}, "text": " Maybe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 498000, "to": 504000}, "text": " So we're just going to install a temporary patch so that we can hook onto one end and"}, {"offsets": {"from": 504000, "to": 507000}, "text": " then find the pair at the other end."}, {"offsets": {"from": 507000, "to": 512000}, "text": " And once we've done that, it should be sweet, patching the whole thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 512000, "to": 520000}, "text": " And we've run Cat6 cable from the lab to the comms cupboard on the level."}, {"offsets": {"from": 520000, "to": 523000}, "text": " But there's only Cat5, not even Cat5e."}, {"offsets": {"from": 523000, "to": 525000}, "text": " I believe it's original Cat5."}, {"offsets": {"from": 525000, "to": 527000}, "text": " Multi-pair stuff running."}, {"offsets": {"from": 527000, "to": 534000}, "text": " That's the big blue trunky wires at the back that are running down through the building."}, {"offsets": {"from": 534000, "to": 536000}, "text": " Does it have a name?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 536000, "to": 537000}, "text": " Corridor?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 537000, "to": 538000}, "text": " What?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 538000, "to": 539000}, "text": " Riser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 539000, "to": 540000}, "text": " Riser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 540000, "to": 541000}, "text": " 49 metres."}, {"offsets": {"from": 541000, "to": 542000}, "text": " That is definitely not..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 542000, "to": 546000}, "text": " Unless it's getting patched through into someone else's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 546000, "to": 547000}, "text": " Possibly, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 549000, "to": 552000}, "text": " But it's definitely not used down here, though."}, {"offsets": {"from": 552000, "to": 553000}, "text": " So it's, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 553000, "to": 555000}, "text": " So it's got to be patched somewhere else."}, {"offsets": {"from": 555000, "to": 557000}, "text": " So it's probably going to someone's office, maybe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 557000, "to": 558000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 558000, "to": 559000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 559000, "to": 560000}, "text": " Feeling lucky?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 560000, "to": 561000}, "text": " Feeling lucky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 561000, "to": 562000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 563000, "to": 564000}, "text": " Oh, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 564000, "to": 565000}, "text": " Oh, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 565000, "to": 566000}, "text": " Look, look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 566000, "to": 569000}, "text": " It's not quite determination error up on the riser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 569000, "to": 570000}, "text": " Oh, is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 570000, "to": 571000}, "text": " See that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 571000, "to": 572000}, "text": " It's not quite joined."}, {"offsets": {"from": 572000, "to": 573000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 573000, "to": 574000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 574000, "to": 577000}, "text": " So if we were to go and test it, we won't get a good speed because it's an open circuit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 577000, "to": 578000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 578000, "to": 580000}, "text": " But if I re-terminate that..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 580000, "to": 581000}, "text": " Sweet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 581000, "to": 582000}, "text": " 66 metres."}, {"offsets": {"from": 582000, "to": 583000}, "text": " 66."}, {"offsets": {"from": 583000, "to": 584000}, "text": " To the riser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 584000, "to": 585000}, "text": " To the riser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 585000, "to": 588000}, "text": " So then there's another probably 20 metres to go to your office."}, {"offsets": {"from": 588000, "to": 589000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 589000, "to": 590000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 590000, "to": 593000}, "text": " But we're still well under the 100, which is the nominal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 593000, "to": 594000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 594000, "to": 596000}, "text": " But Ethernet works beyond 100 anyway, so..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 596000, "to": 599000}, "text": " They advise 100 for the run, and then you've got..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 599000, "to": 600000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600000, "to": 601000}, "text": " For the patch leads as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 601000, "to": 602000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 602000, "to": 603000}, "text": " So..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 603000, "to": 604000}, "text": " Yeah, we're good to go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 605000, "to": 606000}, "text": " We are done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 606000, "to": 608000}, "text": " We finally found a spare pair."}, {"offsets": {"from": 608000, "to": 611000}, "text": " It took a couple of goes, didn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 611000, "to": 612000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 612000, "to": 615000}, "text": " Chrome Tool's good for this because it chops it off as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 615000, "to": 616000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 616000, "to": 618000}, "text": " I've left my Chrome Tool in the van."}, {"offsets": {"from": 618000, "to": 621000}, "text": " In the van, and we couldn't be bothered going up to the van again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 621000, "to": 623000}, "text": " That many trips on the lift, so..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 623000, "to": 624000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 625000, "to": 626000}, "text": " Lovely."}, {"offsets": {"from": 627000, "to": 628000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 628000, "to": 631000}, "text": " Well, we'll find out what our data rate is very shortly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 631000, "to": 632000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 632000, "to": 633000}, "text": " We've got the final run."}, {"offsets": {"from": 633000, "to": 637000}, "text": " You said 64, but you did hedge it to 68."}, {"offsets": {"from": 637000, "to": 639000}, "text": " And I can't remember what I said."}, {"offsets": {"from": 639000, "to": 641000}, "text": " I'll have to watch the video again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 641000, "to": 642000}, "text": " Glear on the screen."}, {"offsets": {"from": 642000, "to": 645000}, "text": " 85 mid, 85.2 meters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 645000, "to": 646000}, "text": " Let's test it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 646000, "to": 647000}, "text": " And test it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 650000, "to": 651000}, "text": " Come on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 651000, "to": 652000}, "text": " We got a gigabit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 652000, "to": 653000}, "text": " A gigabit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 653000, "to": 654000}, "text": " Where's the actual value?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 655000, "to": 656000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 656000, "to": 658000}, "text": " It doesn't actually give you the exact value."}, {"offsets": {"from": 658000, "to": 660000}, "text": " It just tells you it's gigabit capable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 660000, "to": 661000}, "text": " You got a gigabit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 661000, "to": 662000}, "text": " I got a gigabit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 662000, "to": 663000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 663000, "to": 664000}, "text": " Thank you very much, Chris."}, {"offsets": {"from": 664000, "to": 665000}, "text": " You're welcome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 665000, "to": 666000}, "text": " Champion."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}